It’s a centuries-old tradition — a heartfelt greeting spoken aloud with the guest’s name is said to bring good fortune to both the host and the visitor. 
This year, the guest list is longer than ever, and Ravi fears he may accidentally forget someone’s name or misspeak in the chaos.
To ensure every welcome is flawless, you must help him craft a program that takes the guest’s name and instantly produces the warm greeting “Hello !”. 
This way, every visitor will feel seen and honored, and the tradition will remain unbroken.
